# A Journey Begins (abyssea 160), the login's add: a level 99 Warrior in Port Jeuno with the quest available. The
# login: onZoneIn runs first (available: no section, no 324), then xi.player.onGameIn adds the quest (ENABLE_ABYSSEA 1,
# available: player:addQuest; globals/player.lua:196-201). Joachim at Prog 0: nil (his script: Dawn of Death not
# accepted, so nothing). Out and back in: 324, finished: Prog 1. Joachim: 325, finished: completed.
lists PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onZoneIn/1 PortJeuno/onEventFinish/324 PortJeuno/onEventFinish/325
char zone=PortJeuno pos=-51.344,0,-9.978 job=WAR lvl=99
login                                   # no 324 (available at the zone-in); onGameIn adds the quest
trigger Joachim                         # Prog 0: nil; his script plays nothing (Dawn of Death not accepted)
finish-if-event
rezone open                             # accepted, Prog 0: 324, left open
finish                                  # Prog 1
trigger Joachim                         # Prog 1: 325
finish                                  # completed; The Truth Beckons accepted
